gue set in. Argentinos JRS managed their lead effectively, introducing fresh legs like Matias Gimenez Rojas and Claudio Bravo . Despite Belgrano's best efforts to find an equalizer through late substitutes Ramiro Tulian and Lautaro Gutierrez , the visitors held firm. The final whistle after seven minutes of added time confirmed a hard-fought victory for Argentinos JRS , leaving the home fans to rue the early dismissal."
